{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31722","headline":"义雀行和朱评事 · 贾岛","name":"义雀行和朱评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄鸟雄雌俱，春雷惊蛰余。\n口衔黄河泥，空即翔天隅。\n一夕皆莫归，哓哓遗衆雏。\n双雀抱仁义，哺食劳劬劬。\n雏既逦迤飞，云间声相呼。\n燕雀虽微类，感媿诚不殊。\n禽贤难自彰，幸得主人书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}